OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACancer 'sponge' tests could be offered
OL,4,Ato more people with bad indigestion
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people with bad and persistent
OL,7,Findigestion should be offered quick
OL,8,F"sponge in the gullet" tests to check
OL,9,Ffor oesophageal cancer, new draft
OL,10,Fguidelines for the NHS in England
OL,11,Frecommend.
OL,13,FThe sponge tests can be carried out in
OL,14,FGP surgeries in minutes, and are less
OL,15,Finvasive than hospital endoscopy checks
OL,16,Fthat instead use a small camera to look
OL,17,Finside the body.
OL,19,FThey tests are already available in
OL,20,Fsome places but could now be offered
OL,21,Facross England.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
