OL,3,ACancer 'sponge' tests could be offered
OL,4,Ato more people with bad indigestion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeartburn or acid reflux can occur with
OL,7,Fa condition called Barrett's oesophagus
OL,8,Fthat increases the risk of cancer in
OL,9,Fthe long term.
